<title>SWITZERLAND: ATHLETICS-LUCERNE INTERNATIONAL MEETING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-LUCERNE INTERNATIONAL MEETING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LUCERNE, Switzerland 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
