<p>Men's 100 metres</p>
<p>1. Kenneth Brokenburr (U.S.) 10.11 seconds</p>
<p>2. Vincent Henderson (U.S.) 10.26</p>
<p>3. Ian Mackie (Britain) 10.33</p>
